{"id":"n71234-1-12","stage":1,"title":"적다 · 写","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71234-1-12-1","ko":"여기 적은 것들을 혼자서 잘 사 올 수 있겠니?","zh":"这些写在这里的东西，你能自己顺利买回来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"적은","meaning":"写","explanation":"적다：写；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적은","audio":"/audio/c74800f00270311cf930.mp3"}},{"text":"것들을","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것들을","audio":"/audio/c3e08b67689cde164d2e.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자서","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独；서：接在人数表达等后，强调这些人是动作的主体，如 혼자서（独自）。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자서","audio":"/audio/870e79ede59f7c40d822.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}},{"text":"올","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠니?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠니","audio":"/audio/b223c0e014da2a6513bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"71234","definition":"把内容用文字书写处理。","pronunciation":["적따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/faa761fbb02c1522b3ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71234-1-12-2","ko":"네, 엄마. 걱정 마세요.","zh":"能的，妈妈。您别担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1dea5c853231eda6e6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71234","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.863,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你能独自把这里写的东西都卖掉吗？","这些写在这里的东西，你能自己顺利买回来吗？","你已经把这里写的东西全买回来了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不行，妈妈，还是您去买吧。","我忘记买了，妈妈，对不起。","能的，妈妈。您别担心。"],"answer":2}]}
